  "koffie": "<div class=\"yomitan-glossary\"><ol data-count=\"1\"><li data-dictionary=\"wty-nl-en\" data-dictionary-id=\"wty-nl-en\" data-has-styles=\"\"><span class=\"gloss-tag\" data-category=\"partOfSpeech\" title=\"noun\">n</span><span class=\"gloss-tag\" data-category=\"gender-feminine\" title=\"feminine\">fem</span><span class=\"gloss-tag\" data-category=\"gender-masculine\" title=\"masculine\">masc</span><span class=\"gloss-tag\" data-category=\"\" title=\"non-lemma\">non-lemma</span><i>(wty-nl-en)</i><ul class=\"gloss-list\" data-count=\"2\"><li class=\"gloss-item\"><div class=\"gloss-content\"><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\"><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\" data-sc-content=\"preamble\"><details class=\"gloss-sc-details\" data-sc-content=\"details-entry-Grammar\"><summary class=\"gloss-sc-summary\" data-sc-content=\"summary-entry\">Grammar</summary><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\" data-sc-content=\"Grammar-content\">koffie f or m (plural koffies, diminutive koffietje n)</div></details><details class=\"gloss-sc-details\" data-sc-content=\"details-entry-Etymology\"><summary class=\"gloss-sc-summary\" data-sc-content=\"summary-entry\">Etymology</summary><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\" data-sc-content=\"Etymology-content\">Borrowed from Italian caffè, from Ottoman Turkish قهوه (kahve), from Arabic قَهْوَة (qahwa).</div></details></div></div><ol class=\"gloss-sc-ol\" data-sc-content=\"glosses\"><li class=\"gloss-sc-li\"><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\"><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\" data-sc-content=\"tags\"><span class=\"gloss-sc-span\" data-sc-content=\"tag\" data-sc-category=\"grammar\" title=\"uncountable\">uncount</span></div>coffee (beverage)</div></li><li class=\"gloss-sc-li\"><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\"><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\" data-sc-content=\"tags\"><span class=\"gloss-sc-span\" data-sc-content=\"tag\" data-sc-category=\"grammar\" title=\"countable\">count</span></div>coffee (serving of the above beverage)</div></li></ol><div class=\"gloss-sc-div\" data-sc-content=\"backlink\